abstract: >-
  ENTITY is an open protocol and reference implementation for persistent digital
  identity, delegated authority, provenance and evidence, rights, portable
  recovery, and interoperable economic state. ENTITY v3.4.2 introduces the
  Blackmore Technology Data Universe (BTDU), an ENTITY-governed atom/bond
  information substrate that preserves protocol authority, rights, provenance,
  recovery, and economic boundaries.
